{"unit_id":2,"stage_id":2,"lesson":{"lesson_id":7,"lesson_key":"S2L7","stage_id":2,"title":"Harf-e-Jarr 'Bi' (Se / Ke saath / Par): الْكِتَابُ ← بِالْكِتَابِ","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Harf-e-Jarr 'Bi' (Se / Ke saath / Par): الْكِتَابُ ← بِالْكِتَابِ","en":"Preposition 'Bi-' (With / By): الْكِتَابُ ← بِالْكِتَابِ","ur":"حرفِ جر 'بِـ' (سے / کے ساتھ / پر): الْكِتَابُ ← بِالْكِتَابِ","hi":"हर्फ़-ए-जर्र 'बि' (से / के साथ / पर): الْكِتَابُ ← بِالْكِتَابِ"},"arabic_Focus":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْحَقُّ ← بِالْكِتَابِ ، بِالْحَقِّ","hinglish_Focus":"Kitaab, Haq → Kitaab ke saath, Haq ke saath","page_numbers":"64–65","book_page":64,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْحَقُّ ← بِالْكِتَابِ ، بِالْحَقِّ","hinglish":"Kitaab, Haq → Kitaab ke saath, Haq ke saath","arabic_word":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْحَقُّ","arabic_combined":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْحَقُّ ← بِالْكِتَابِ ، بِالْحَقِّ","hinglish_word":"Kitaab, Haq","hinglish_combined":"Kitaab, Haq → Kitaab ke saath, Haq ke saath","title_en":"Harf-e-Jarr 'Bi' (Se / Ke saath / Par): الْكِتَابُ ← بِالْكِتَابِ","subtitle":"Unit 2 • Lesson 7 (Book Page 64–65)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْحَقُّ","after_ar":"بِالْكِتَابِ ، بِالْحَقِّ","before_hi":"Kitaab, Haq","after_hi":"Kitaab ke saath, Haq ke saath"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S2L7 — Harf-e-Jarr 'Bi' (Se / Ke saath / Par): الْكِتَابُ ← بِالْكِتَابِ: Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S2L7 — Harf-e-Jarr 'Bi' (Se / Ke saath / Par): الْكِتَابُ ← بِالْكِتَابِ: Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qaa'ida / Halat","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["بِـ + الْـ (Zair ـِ)","بِالْكِتَابِ / بِالْحَقِّ / بِالْإِيمَانِ / بِالصَّبْرِ","Kitaab ke saath / Haq ke saath / Imaan ke saath / Sabr ke zariye"],["بِـ + Nakirah (Do Zair ـٍ)","بِسُلْطَانٍ / بِشَيْءٍ / بِغَيْرِ حِسَابٍ","Kisi daleel ke saath / Kisi cheez ke saath / Be-hisaab"],["بِـ (Ke badle mein)","النَّفْسَ بِالنَّفْسِ وَالْعَيْنَ بِالْعَيْنِ","Jaan ke badle jaan aur aankh ke badle aankh"]]}},{"id":"sec_s2l7_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 2 • LESSON 7</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Jarr 'Bi' (Se / Ke saath / Par): الْكِتَابُ ← بِالْكِتَابِ (Page 64–65)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْكِتَابُ ، الْحَقُّ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Jarr (بِـ + ـِ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">بِالْكِتَابِ ، بِالْحَقِّ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الْكِتَابُ ، الْحَقُّ (Kitaab, Haq) se بِالْكِتَابِ ، بِالْحَقِّ (Kitaab ke saath, Haq ke saath) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Huroof-e-Jarr, Inna, Laa, Illaa, Kaana aur Yaa Qur'ani jumlon ki buniyadi chabiyan hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 64–65):** **`بِـ`** ka matlab siyaaq ke mutabiq **'se / ke saath / ke zariye / par / ke badle'** hota hai, aur iske baad wale lafz ke neeche **Zair (`ـِ / ـٍ`)** aati hai: `بِالْكِتَابِ`، `بِالصَّبْرِ وَالصَّلَاةِ`، `يُؤْمِنُونَ بِالْغَيْبِ`."}},{"id":"sec_s2l7_r2","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Pehle column ke teeno alfaaz ko column 2 mein shuru mein (بِـ) laga kar dobara likha gaya hai. Aur iss izaafe ke saath har lafz ke aakhir mein zer (kasrah) aane se iska matlab 'ko / ke saath / se / ke liye / mein' (toh/zariye/saath/ke liye/mein) banta hai. • (بِـ) ek khaas Arabi lafz hai jiska tarjuma context (siyaaq-o-sabaaq) ke mutabiq hota hai. Iska matlab 'ko / ke saath / se / ke liye / mein' ho sakta hai. Pehli misaal dekh kar darj zail Qur'ani fiqron ka tarjuma khud kijiye:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l7_g3","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l7_g3_w1","arabic":"بِالْبَاطِلِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَاطِلِ</span>","hinglish":"Baatil ke saath","translations":{"en":"With falsehood","ur":"باطل کے ساتھ","hi":"बातिल के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w2","arabic":"بِالْإِيمَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بِالْإِيمَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Eemaan ke saath","translations":{"en":"With faith","ur":"ایمان کے ساتھ","hi":"ईमान के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w3","arabic":"بِالرَّحْمَنِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الرَّحْمَنِ</span>","hinglish":"Rahman ke saath","translations":{"en":"In the Most Merciful","ur":"رحمٰن پر / رحمٰن کے ساتھ","hi":"रहमान पर / रहमान के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w4","arabic":"بِاللَّهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span>","hinglish":"Allah ke saath / se","translations":{"en":"In Allah / with Allah","ur":"اللہ پر / اللہ کے ساتھ","hi":"अल्लाह पर / अल्लाह के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w5","arabic":"بِالْحَيَاةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَيَاةِ</span>","hinglish":"Zindagi ke saath","translations":{"en":"With life","ur":"زندگی کے ساتھ","hi":"ज़िंदगी के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w6","arabic":"بِالْأَمْنِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بِالْأَمْنِ</span>","hinglish":"Amn ke saath","translations":{"en":"With security / peace","ur":"امن کے ساتھ","hi":"अम्न के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w7","arabic":"بِالذِّكْرِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بِالذِّكْرِ</span>","hinglish":"Zikr ke saath","translations":{"en":"With remembrance","ur":"ذکر کے ساتھ","hi":"ज़िक्र के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w8","arabic":"بِالْآخِرَةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْآخِرَةِ</span>","hinglish":"Aakhirat ke saath","translations":{"en":"In the Hereafter","ur":"آخرت پر / آخرت کے ساتھ","hi":"आख़िरत पर / आख़िरत के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w9","arabic":"بِالْحِكْمَةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بِالْحِكْمَةِ</span>","hinglish":"Hikmat ke saath","translations":{"en":"With wisdom","ur":"حکمت کے ساتھ","hi":"हिकमत के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w10","arabic":"بِالْكُفْرِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكُفْرِ</span>","hinglish":"Kufr ke saath","translations":{"en":"With disbelief","ur":"کفر کے ساتھ","hi":"कुफ़्र के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w11","arabic":"بِالسَّاعَةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّاعَةِ</span>","hinglish":"Qayamat ke saath","translations":{"en":"In the Hour (Resurrection)","ur":"قیامت پر / قیامت کے ساتھ","hi":"क़यामत पर / क़यामत के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w12","arabic":"بِالدِّينِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الدِّينِ</span>","hinglish":"Deen ke saath","translations":{"en":"In the Judgement / religion","ur":"دین / جزا کے دن پر","hi":"दीन / बदले के दिन पर"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w13","arabic":"بِالْقَوْلِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقَوْلِ</span>","hinglish":"Baat ke saath","translations":{"en":"With the speech / word","ur":"بات / قول کے ساتھ","hi":"बात / क़ौल के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w14","arabic":"بِالشَّمْسِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الشَّمْسِ</span>","hinglish":"Suraj ke saath","translations":{"en":"With the sun","ur":"سورج کے ساتھ","hi":"सूरज के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w15","arabic":"بِالسُّوءِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">السُّوءِ</span>","hinglish":"Buraai ke saath","translations":{"en":"With evil","ur":"برائی کے ساتھ","hi":"बुराई के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w16","arabic":"بِالْحَسَنَةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَسَنَةِ</span>","hinglish":"Neki ke saath","translations":{"en":"With good / a good deed","ur":"نیکی کے ساتھ","hi":"नेकी के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w17","arabic":"بِالطَّاغُوتِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الطَّاغُوتِ</span>","hinglish":"Taghoot ke saath","translations":{"en":"In Taghut (false deities)","ur":"طاغوت پر / طاغوت کے ساتھ","hi":"ताग़ूत पर / ताग़ूत के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w18","arabic":"بِالرُّوحِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الرُّوحِ</span>","hinglish":"Rooh ke saath","translations":{"en":"With the Spirit (Gabriel)","ur":"روح کے ساتھ","hi":"रूह के साथ"}},{"id":"s2l7_g3_w19","arabic":"بِالْمَعْرُوفِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَعْرُوفِ</span>","h